https://github.com/PhairZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T18:08:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T18:08:00Z","body":"I'll try to look further for a better solution.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781023133/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781721038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105057#issuecomment-2781721038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105057","id":2781721038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lzbHO","user":{"login":"PhairZ","id":123702514,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1-M8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123702514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ","html_url":"https://github.com/PhairZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-06T23:17:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-06T23:21:21Z","body":"I've done some investigation and I wasn't able to find a solution other than using `is_inside_tree()` to check if the Node instance is valid. Any other solution would need modyfing the logic way too much.\r\n\r\nThe old version of this still had that Issue but got away due to not needing to cast the elements of `selected_particles`.\r\nCode from before #102249 :\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid GPUParticles2DEditorPlugin::_selection_changed() {\r\n\tList<Node *> selected_nodes = EditorNode::get_singleton()->get_editor_selection()->get_selected_node_list();\r\n\tif (selected_particles.is_empty() && selected_nodes.is_empty()) {\r\n\t\treturn;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tfor (GPUParticles2D *particles : selected_particles) {\r\n\t\tparticles->set_show_visibility_rect(false);\r\n\t}\r\n\tselected_particles.clear();\r\n\r\n\tfor (Node *node : selected_nodes) {\r\n\t\tGPUParticles2D *selected_particle = Object::cast_to<GPUParticles2D>(node);\r\n\t\tif (selected_particle) {\r\n\t\t\tselected_particle->set_show_visibility_rect(true);\r\n\t\t\tselected_particles.push_back(selected_particle);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\nThis would still have an instance of particles pointing to a Node that's no longer in Tree but it would call the method anyway.\r\nI don't see a reason this problem needs to be overcomplicated. Maybe calling it a Dangling pointer was a mistake. It's really just a node that got removed from the scene tree due to the edited scene being closed.\r\n\r\nEDIT: PR Description updated accordingly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781721038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2783304596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105057#issuecomment-2783304596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105057","id":2783304596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l5duU","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T13:15:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T13:15:46Z","body":"CC @Arnklit ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2783304596/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2793780763","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105057#issuecomment-2793780763","issue_url":"https://api.githu